1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:03,630
The etiquette of sharʿī ruqyah that many people overlook:

2
00:00:04,310 --> 00:00:04,650
First:

3
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:05,940
Be sincere to Allah,

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,850
recite with certainty and a present heart,

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,720
and believe that healing is in Allah’s hand alone.

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:10,510
Second:

7
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:14,280
Stick to the Qur’an and the adhkar authentically reported from the Prophet (peace be upon him),

8
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:17,230
and do not accept words you do not understand or unknown symbols.

9
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:18,240
Third:

10
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:19,990
Place your hand on the place of pain,

11
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,040
as the Prophet (peace be upon him) taught,

12
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:24,180
and a light blowing is fine, without exaggeration.

13
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:25,240
Fourth:

14
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:26,940
It is recommended to be in a state of purity

15
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,930
and to supplicate with humility and brokenness,

16
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:30,540
for that is closer to being answered.

17
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:31,540
Fifth:

18
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,760
Do not be alone with an unrelated woman for ruqyah,

19
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:36,920
do not strike the patient, and do not demand money in return for healing.

20
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:37,880
And finally:

21
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:40,250
Combine ruqyah with taking the means of treatment,

22
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:42,840
for this is the guidance of the Prophet (peace be upon him).

23
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,840
Share this clip with someone you love, and follow the channel.

